# held/props/spoon_child: the child's wooden spoon in the right hand and the bowl it eats from in the left (WEAPONS w2r3, a
# proposal for the planner: held/props is frozen in wave 2) for SitEat and SitFloorEat. The adult's (held/props/spoon) cut
# to the child's 21 px: a 2 px spoon, a 5 px bowl. Format: rpg/art/doll/doll.h. Anchored on the child's right shoulder
# (kin/child/arms/arm_r): the bowl at the left fist's grip, the spoon at the right's: up to the mouth, down to the bowl.
